# The ~/.zshrc file is sourced for interactive shells only. It configures the
# appearance and behavior of the shell: prompt, aliases, keybindings, history,
# and completions.
#
# Environment variables and PATH setup belong in ~/.zshenv (sourced for ALL
# shell invocations, including scripts, git hooks, and editor subprocesses).
#
#   ln -s path/to/dotfiles/zsh/zshrc ~/.zshrc
#



